[engl]
{100}{}{Vinnie}
{200}{}{You see Vinnie from the Skulz gang.}
{210}{}{You see a young man with a tattoo and a bad attitude.}
{1000}{}{[AUTO-GENERATED SKELETON: replace this entry with the NPC's initial greeting and
conditions.]}
{1010}{}{[MANUAL: initial branch condition/greeting -> Vinnie24]}
{2000}{}{You ready to take out Neal?}
{2010}{}{Yeah, let's ice the bastard.}
{2020}{}{Nah, I got some more stuff to do.}
{2030}{}{No way. I want out.}
{3000}{}{Uh, all right . . . meet us later, but don't take too long.}
{3010}{}{[Done.]}
{4000}{}{It's too late for that, slick. When you're out, you're way out.}
{4010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> VinnieCombat]}
{5000}{}{You got it?}
{5010}{}{I had to kill Neal to get it. He cried like a little girl.}
{5020}{}{Yep.}
{5030}{}{No.}
{6000}{}{That'll show that old fuck. Thanks for taking care of him for us. [Vinnie gets a tear in
his eye.] You're a Skul, now.}
{6010}{}{[Done.]}
{7000}{}{Ha ha! Let that old cock suffer until we off him tonight - are you in?}
{7010}{}{I decided I'd rather not have anything to do with scabs like you.}
{7020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Vinnie22]}
{7030}{}{Let's crush him.}
{7040}{}{I've got some other shit to do before then - I'll meet you there.}
{8000}{}{What?! You'll pay for that remark!}
{8010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> VinnieCombat]}
{9000}{}{What are you wasting my time for?}
{9010}{}{[Done.]}
{10000}{}{What do you want now?}
{10010}{}{I'd like to join you guys.}
{10020}{}{Nothing. Sorry.}
{11000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Vinnie01a']}
{11010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Vinnie14]}
{11020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Vinnie15]}
{12000}{}{You want to join us, huh? How do we know you're tough enough to be a Skul?}
{12010}{}{I'll show you tough enough, you son of a bitch!}
{12020}{}{Let me prove myself to you.}
{12030}{}{Trust me, I'm tough enough.}
{13000}{}{[Vinnie thinks for a second.] If you want to prove you belong in the Skulz, I want you
to steal that old bastard's wife's ashes. Heh. [Vinnie mumbles] Let's make Neal suffer
for his last couple of hours . . .}
{13010}{}{I already stole it.}
{13020}{}{Uh, I don't think I could do that.}
{13030}{}{That won't be as tough as you might think. I already killed the bastard.}
{13040}{}{All right, I'll do it.}
{13050}{}{No way.}
{14000}{}{Get out of here, you moron!}
{14010}{}{[Done.]}
{15000}{}{If you're hard enough to do that, mebbe you'd make a Skul after all. Bring it here once
you've got it.}
{15010}{}{[Done.]}
{16000}{}{I knew you weren't Skulz material. Get the hell out of here.}
{16010}{}{[Done.]}
{17000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Vinnie14a']}
{17010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Vinnie15]}
{17020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Vinnie16]}
{18000}{}{[Vinnie looks at you and laughs.] I don't think so.}
{18010}{}{What makes the Skulz so tough?}
{18020}{}{You're right, I'll be leaving now.}
{18030}{}{That's it. Time for you to die.}
{18040}{}{I'll prove it to you.}
{19000}{}{We are the one and only Junktown gang. We have the run of the streets, and we rule the
city at night.}
{19010}{}{Oh. Sorry. Bye.}
{19020}{}{You couldn't run the schoolyard, Chromo.}
{19030}{}{I thought this city was run by Gizmo after hours.}
{20000}{}{That slob can't even stand up by himself. We're the muscle in this town. We take what we
want.}
{20010}{}{I see.}
{20020}{}{You have some sort of deal with Killian?}
{21000}{}{We don't bother Killian and he doesn't bother us as long as we keep it low-key. You get
me?}
{21010}{}{Yeah. Bye.}
{21020}{}{I get it, all right. You have to hide out from him.}
{22000}{}{We don't take that from anybody, least of all Killian! Just because he thinks he's a
glorified sheriff doesn't mean that he controls the Skulz!}
{22010}{}{Sorry, didn't mean to get you all riled up.}
{22020}{}{So, he cramps your style, eh? Mine, too. In fact, I'm thinking of whacking him. You want
in?}
{23000}{}{You want to whack Killian? Man, you're crazy. Man, I don't know . . . all right, I'm in.}
{23010}{}{[Done.]}
{24000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Vinnie15a']}
{24010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Vinnie04]}
{24020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Vinnie16]}
{25000}{}{You're on Skulz turf, stranger. You'd better talk quick.}
{25010}{}{Sorry, wrong room.}
{25020}{}{Skulz? Who are you guys?}
{25030}{}{I'd like to join you guys.}
{25040}{}{Urgh?}
{26000}{}{Yeah, you bet this is the wrong room!}
{26010}{}{[Done.]}

